<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel car traffic down in March vs pvs year.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel car traffic down in March vs pvs year.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel gave the following traffic figures for March.</p>
<p>		     March 1997	March 1996    Total 1997</p>
<p>Shuttle traffic</p>
<p> cars		 149,619	   152,875	  357,068</p>
<p> coaches		4,177	     5,619	    7,727</p>
<p> freight (trucks)	 0	    46,534		  0</p>
<p> Eurostar	    500,899	   389,069	  1,200,650</p>
<p>		     passengers	passengers	passengers</p>
<p>Railfreight    230,753 tonnes  207,417 tonnes  634,058 tonnes</p>
<p>NOTE: &quot;Cars&quot; in Eurotunnel statements include motorcycles, trailers, caravans and campervans.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
</text>
